:: MMA Gym
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "mma_gym">><<effects>>
You are in the MMA Gym. Here you can pay for lessons to improve your fighting skill. They also offer classes on footwork, striking, kicking and conditioning. The instructor is a grizzled veteran who grew up in town, hardened by years of street brawls and cage fights. Their teaching style is all about tough love—no hand-holding, no sugarcoating, just brutal honesty and hard-earned wisdom.
<br><br>

<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<<passoutshop>>
<<else>>
	<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
		<<orgasmLocation "mmaGym">>
	<</if>>
    <<if Time.hour is $closinghour>>
		It's closing time. The receptionist is herding everyone outside.<<if $exposed gte 1>>Panic swells within you as you realise how exposed you'll be should you be found in this state of dress.<</if>>
		<br>
	<<elseif $openinghours is 0>>
		You are alone in the darkness.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $openinghours is 1 and $exposed lt 1>>
		<!-- <<if $mma_job_intro>>
			<<if $weekly.mmaJob is "done">>
				<span class="blue">Riley will have another job for you next week.</span>
				<br>
			<<else>>
				<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask for work|MMA Job Ask]]>><</link>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>> -->
		<<if $exposed lt 1>>
			<<if $combatExtended.standingFights is 1 and $combatExtended.footwork is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1200>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a footwork lesson (£12 1:00)|Footwork Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<set $usedEvents = []>><<money -1200 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gtiredness>><<note "+ + Footwork Skill" "green">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a footwork lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $combatExtended.striking is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1800>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a striking lesson (£18 1:00)|Striking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<set $usedEvents = []>><<money -1800 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gtiredness>><<note "+ + Striking Skill" "green">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a striking lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
			<<if $combatExtended.kicking is 1>>
				<<if $money gte 1800>>
					<<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a kicking lesson (£18 1:00)|Kicking Lesson]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<set $gymstage to 0>><<money -1800 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<gtiredness>><<note "+ + Kicking Skill" "green">>
					<br>
				<<else>>
					<span class="blue">You can't afford a kicking lesson.</span>
					<br>
				<</if>>
			<</if>>
            <<if $money gte 1000>>
                <<mmagymicon>><<link [[Take a conditioning lesson (£10 1:00)|Conditioning Lesson 1]]>><<set $phase to 0>><<money -1000 "mmaGymLessons">><</link>><<ggtiredness>><<note "+ + Conditioning" "green">>
                <br>
			<<else>>
				<span class="blue">You can't afford a conditioning lesson.</span>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $openinghours is 0 and Time.hour isnot $closinghour and !$weekly.theft.mmaGym>>
		<<shopicon "register">><<link [[Examine the cash register|MMA Gym Register]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<br>
	<<nightingaleicon>><<link [[Leave|Nightingale Street]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

:: MMA Gym Lock
<<set $outside to 1>><<effects>><<set $lock to 200>>
<<openinghours>>
<<if currentSkillValue('skulduggery') gte $lock>>
	<<if $leftarm is "bound" and $rightarm is "bound">>
		You think you'd be able to pick the lock, <span class="blue">if your arms weren't bound.</span>
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<<wearProp "lockpick">>
		<span class="green">The lock looks easy to pick.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Pick it (0:10)|MMA Gym]]>><<handheldon>><<pass 10>><<crimeUp 5 "trespassing">><</link>><<crime "trespassing">>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">The lock looks beyond your ability to pick.</span><<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Nightingale Street]]>><<handheldon>><</link>>
<br>

:: MMA Gym Introduction
<<effects>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
    You shift on your feet, voice barely above a whisper. "H-hello..."
    <br><br>
    Riley gives you one look and sighs. "You better learn to speak up, kid. No one's gonna hear you mumbling when you're on your back." <<He>> jerks a thumb toward the gym. "Get over there. If you're too scared to train, you might as well leave now."
    <br><br>
    The words sting, but there's no real malice behind them—just blunt truth. You shuffle toward the group, heart pounding, as Riley turns back to the class. The lesson begins.
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
    You step in with a grin. "Pleased to meet you! I can't wait to get started!"
    <br><br>
    Riley snorts, arms still crossed. "Cute. Let's see if you're still smiling when your lungs give out." <<He>> gestures toward the gym. "Name's Riley. You listen, you last. You don't, you get humbled. Now move."
    <br><br>
    You nod and fall into place, ready to start as Riley turns back to the class. The lesson begins.
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
    <<promiscuity1>>"Nice outfit. Really shows off your assets." You let your eyes linger, making your intent obvious.
    <br><br>
    Riley doesn't even blink. Just stares at you, unreadable. "That's cute. You think this is a club or a gym?" <<He>> steps past you, already done with the conversation. "If you're here to train, get in line. If not, door's behind you."
    <br><br>
    The air shifts immediately—your little game just bounced off a brick wall. Riley doesn't react further, already focused on the lesson.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|$mmaGymIntroExit]]>><<unset $mmaGymIntroExit>><<endevent>><</link>>
